      "message": "fix: resolve Supabase 503 + increase generateLink timeout for Render free tier\n\nP0-1: credential-sync tested service-role key against SUPABASE_URL instead of\nEXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL (which all other modules use first). If SUPABASE_URL\npoints to a different/paused project, the key test hits the wrong endpoint\nand returns 503. Fixed to use EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL || SUPABASE_URL.\n\nP0-2: generateLink timeout was 12s, too short for Render free tier cold starts.\nIncreased to 30s to allow Supabase admin API adequate response time.",
